                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Two pandemics happening simultaneously, such as flu and COVID-19."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8662c18d-24ef-4ba9-8254-d2b1ca3d5e8a",
                                                "sense_id": "c38f574a-fa20-3ea1-afdb-9707c4425e4a",
                                                "text": "Tonight it is being called a potential ‘twindemic’, the flu season and COVID coinciding this fall with deadly results."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed984951-1a64-450c-8411-5b71a921664c",
                                                "sense_id": "c38f574a-fa20-3ea1-afdb-9707c4425e4a",
                                                "text": "This further exacerbated the diagnostic challenge posed by undifferentiated febrile illness during a “twindemic” of both COVID-19 and dengue, as both illnesses could potentially present with febrile syndromes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
